WEBVTT

00:00:02.498 --> 00:00:04.500
Dad?

00:00:39.243 --> 00:00:44.206
Harry: Ron, you've really gotta
see this! Ron, you've gotta see this!

00:00:46.042 --> 00:00:48.878
Ron, come on, get out of bed!

00:00:49.128 --> 00:00:52.715
- —Why?- There's something you've got to see!

00:00:59.388 --> 00:01:03.726
Come on! Come!
Come look, it's my parents!

00:01:05.186 --> 00:01:07.146
I only see us.

00:01:07.396 --> 00:01:10.733
Look in properly.
Go on, stand there.

00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:16.864
- There. You see them, don't you?
- That's me! Only I'm head boy.

00:01:17.365 --> 00:01:19.700
And I'm holding the Quidditch cup.

00:01:19.909 --> 00:01:24.080
And bloody hell!
I'm Quidditch captain too!

00:01:25.247 --> 00:01:27.708
I look good.

00:01:28.334 --> 00:01:32.171
Harry, do you think this mirror
shows the future?

00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:37.343
How can it?
Both my parents are dead.

00:02:00.449 --> 00:02:02.618
Back again, Harry?

00:02:05.746 --> 00:02:08.249
I see that you,
like many before you...

00:02:08.457 --> 00:02:12.628
Have discovered the delights
of the mirror of erised.

00:02:12.962 --> 00:02:17.133
I trust by now
you realize what it does.

00:02:18.426 --> 00:02:20.970
Let me give you a clue.

00:02:21.470 --> 00:02:23.639
The happiest man on earth...

00:02:23.848 --> 00:02:27.226
Would look in the mirror
and see only himself...

00:02:27.435 --> 00:02:29.770
Exactly as he is.

00:02:29.979 --> 00:02:34.984
So then, it shows us what we want.
Whatever we want.

00:02:38.988 --> 00:02:41.490
It shows us nothing more or less...

00:02:41.657 --> 00:02:47.663
Than the deepest and most desperate
desires of our hearts.

00:02:47.872 --> 00:02:52.585
Now you, Harry, who have
never known your family...

00:02:52.793 --> 00:02:56.672
You see them standing beside you.

00:02:56.881 --> 00:02:59.300
But remember this, Harry.

00:02:59.508 --> 00:03:05.431
This mirror gives us
neither knowledge...

00:03:05.639 --> 00:03:07.767
Or truth.

00:03:08.684 --> 00:03:14.774
Men have wasted away in front of it.
Even gone mad.

00:03:15.816 --> 00:03:19.945
That is why tomorrow
it will be moved to a new home.

00:03:20.154 --> 00:03:22.031
And I must ask you...

00:03:23.032 --> 00:03:26.911
Not to go looking for it again.

00:03:27.661 --> 00:03:30.790
It does not do to dwell on dreams...
